    <bpmn:process id="W_W5021" name="W5021. Capital-Markets &amp; Securities-Offering Transaction Disclosure &amp; Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Debt/equity/securities offering; facility/rating action; refinancing; M&amp;A (VS-130)
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: ~1–3 capital-markets transactions per year (bond/commercial-paper issuances per W319)
Owner: VP Investor Relations / CFO / Treasurer (VS-18)
Participants: Treasury (VS-18), Legal (VS-100), ABL/collateral (VS-170), Strategy (VS-33), M&amp;A (VS-130), External counsel/underwriters, Compliance (VS-22)
Source: workflow W5021 — Capital-Markets &amp; Securities-Offering Transaction Disclosure &amp; Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
