        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-117 (ensure disclosure &amp; insider-trading compliance.) | - CTL-750: offering docs legally/audit-reviewed &amp; disclosure-controlled (W5017); fair process; post-issuance reporting tracked (VS-18)
Owner: VP Investor Relations / CFO / Treasurer (VS-18)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
