    <bpmn:process id="W_W5022" name="W5022. Insider List, Trading-Window &amp; Securities-Trading Compliance (RA 8799 SRC)" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program setup; insider-list change; trading-window open/close; trade request; closed period
Frequency: Continuous + per-window + per-trade
Volume: ~30–50 insiders in the population × trades × closed/open windows
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance (VS-100) / Compliance (VS-22) / VP Investor Relations
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), Legal (VS-100), HR (VS-19), Finance (VS-17/VS-18), Internal Audit (VS-21)
Source: workflow W5022 — Insider List, Trading-Window &amp; Securities-Trading Compliance (RA 8799 SRC)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5022_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5022_Lane1" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5022_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5022_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5022_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5022_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5022_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5022_Start3" name="Program setup; insider-list change; trading-window open/close; trade request; closed…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5022_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5022_Task4" name="Maintain the insider list &amp; policy: the insiders register…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the insider list &amp; policy: the insiders register (directors/officers/key employees with material non-public info — links VS-36 board, VS-19 HR), the securities-trading policy, blackout/closed periods (pre-earnings), and pre-clearance of trades
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal / VP IR
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5022_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5022_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5022_Task5" name="Operate the trading window &amp; pre-clearance: open/close the window around…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Operate the trading window &amp; pre-clearance: open/close the window around earnings (links W5011) and material events (W5019), pre-clear &amp; log every insider trade, and enforce the ban on trading on material non-public info (RA 8799 Securities Regulation Code — insider trading is a criminal offense)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per window/trade</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5022_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5022_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5022_Task6" name="Report &amp; monitor: insider-trade reporting/filing (links VS-100, VS-166)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report &amp; monitor: insider-trade reporting/filing (links VS-100, VS-166), monitor for suspicious/Rule-10b5-equivalent patterns, and audit insider-list/trade logs (VS-21); coordinate investigations (VS-119/VS-86)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Internal Audit / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5022_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5022_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5022_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5022_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5022_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-117 (ensure disclosure &amp; insider-trading compliance.) | - CTL-750: insider list maintained; window/pre-clearance enforced; RA 8799 insider-trading ban; trades reported/audited
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance (VS-100) / Compliance (VS-22) / VP Investor Relations</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
