    <bpmn:process id="W_W5023" name="W5023. Related-Party Transaction, Beneficial-Ownership &amp; Group / Corporate-Structure Disclosure" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Related-party transaction; ownership/beneficial-owner change; group/entity restructure; annual report (W5018)
Frequency: Continuous + annual disclosure
Volume: ~100–200 related-party transactions + ownership changes per year × 5 entities
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance (VS-100) / VP Investor Relations / Compliance (VS-22)
Participants: Legal (VS-100), Compliance (VS-22), Finance/Intercompany (VS-72), Governance (VS-36), Internal Audit (VS-21), VP IR
Source: workflow W5023 — Related-Party Transaction, Beneficial-Ownership &amp; Group / Corporate-Structure Disclosure</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5023_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5023_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5023_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5023_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5023_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5023_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5023_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5023_Start3" name="Related-party transaction; ownership/beneficial-owner change; group/entity restructure…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5023_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5023_Task4" name="Track &amp; disclose related-party transactions: identify RPTs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Track &amp; disclose related-party transactions: identify RPTs (directors/officers/controlling shareholders/affiliates), ensure arm&#x27;s-length/fair-value terms, board/audit-committee approval (links VS-36), and disclose per securities/SEC standards (links W5018 annual report)
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance / Audit / Finance
Accountable (A): Audit Committee / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5023_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5023_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5023_Task5" name="Maintain &amp; disclose beneficial ownership &amp; group structure: beneficial-owner…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Maintain &amp; disclose beneficial ownership &amp; group structure: beneficial-owner mapping (links W5010 ownership intelligence), the 5-entity group/corporate-structure (links VS-72 intercompany), control/controlling-shareholder relationships, and threshold-crossing disclosure (links W5019)
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance / VP IR
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5023_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5023_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5023_Task6" name="Reconcile &amp; assure: reconcile RPTs to the accounts (VS-17 intercompany), assure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Reconcile &amp; assure: reconcile RPTs to the accounts (VS-17 intercompany), assure disclosures (VS-21), and manage any RPT/ownership controversy as a disclosure event (W5019)
Responsible (R): Legal / Audit / VP IR
Accountable (A): VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Continuous + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5023_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5023_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5023_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5023_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5023_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-750 (ensure controlled execution — Corporate Disclosure, Securities &amp; SEC/Regulatory Compliance (PA-173.2).) | - CTL-750: RPT register, arm&#x27;s-length &amp; audit-committee-approved; beneficial-ownership disclosed; reconciled to accounts (VS-17); audited (VS-21)
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance (VS-100) / VP Investor Relations / Compliance (VS-22)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
